## Color Mandate

This mandate is computed from recent builds and today's signals. Treat it as strong guidance, not law.

- **Target hue range:** 40°–80°
- **Avoid these hue zones (recent palettes):** 16°–76°, 255°–315°
- **Rationale:** Target hue range 40-80° (warm sunny). Recent primary hues: 46°, 285°.

If your chosen primary hue falls outside the target range or inside a forbidden zone, justify why in your color story.

---

## Shell Mandate

Computed from recent builds. The page shell (footer treatment, brand lockup) and the header (placement, nav treatment, mark size) must be DECLARED choices, not defaults. Treat this as strong guidance, not law.

- **Header placements used recently (avoid):** right-margin, masthead
- **Nav treatments used recently (avoid):** marginal — three lowercase links stacked in the top-right margin of the dark ledger panel, no band, no pills, no border, band — a full-width masthead bar with three uppercase links right-aligned
- **Footer treatments used recently (avoid):** ledger foot — build stamp + season + music folded into the base of the right ledger column, running foot — signals as one line of small caps across the base
- **Brand lockups used recently (avoid):** horizontal-md, masthead-lg
- **Mark size bands used recently (avoid):** 28-44

- **Rationale:** Last 2 shells: 2026-08-30: placement=right-margin, nav=marginal — three lowercase links stacked in the top-right margin of the dark ledger panel, no band, no pills, no border, footer=ledger foot — build stamp + season + music folded into the base of the right ledger column, lockup=horizontal-md (single-color), mark=28-44 | 2026-08-29: placement=masthead, nav=band — a full-width masthead bar with three uppercase links right-aligned, footer=running foot — signals as one line of small caps across the base, lockup=masthead-lg (original), mark=28-44

If today's brief genuinely calls for a recently-used treatment, you may reuse it — justify why in your rationale. Fit > novelty.

