## Recent Lessons — recurring flaws; do NOT repeat these

- [2026-08-30, owner (grade B)] The marginal nav is easy to miss against the dark panel. — try: Give the nav a little more presence without turning it into a band.
- [2026-08-30, mockup-critic] The ledger rows run past the right edge at 1440 and the nav links sit inside the gutter. Pull the ledger column in and give the nav its own margin.
- [2026-08-29, screenshot-critic] The masthead lockup renders at half the declared mark_px and the footer line wraps at 1024. Set the mark to 32px and let the footer truncate.

**Responsible agent:** react-engineer

